\pard\qc\sa150\i\fs18\cf6 Mobile state. Controls and metrics reflow into compact grids, panels stack vertically, and the dependency graph remains readable through horizontal scrolling.\i0\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\fs20\cf1 The same content is preserved at all supported widths:\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab On wide desktop screens, order workflows use the main column and worker/explanation panels form a right rail.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab On medium screens, the right rail moves below the simulation instead of compressing text.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab On phones, controls and metric cards use two-column grids and secondary sections stack into one column.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab Dependency graphs retain legible nodes and use horizontal scrolling when the screen is narrower than the workflow.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab Buttons remain full-height touch targets and labels stay visible.\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\fs20\cf1 This is a full-width layout with a small page gutter rather than a narrow fixed-width canvas. It uses CSS Grid for page regions and Flexbox where content needs to wrap naturally.\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\keepn\sb280\sa130\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw12\brdrcf2\b\fs28\cf1 13. Color and visual-language reference\b0\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 \b Color family\tab Meaning\b0 \par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 Dark slate / navy\tab Application identity and experiment controls.\par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 Teal\tab Primary action and live completion progress.\par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 Indigo\tab AI identity and AI-owned work.\par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 Ochre / amber\tab Human identity, human-owned work, or attention.\par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 Green\tab Completed, successful, or stable state.\par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 Red\tab High urgency, zero-shot warning, missed deadline, conflict, or failure.\par
\pard\tx2600\tx5300\tx7900\tx10500\sb65\sa65\fs18 Grey\tab Blocked, disabled, or secondary information.\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\fs20\cf1 Color is reinforced by text, labels, percentages, and status words so it is never the only way to understand a state.\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\keepn\sb280\sa130\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw12\brdrcf2\b\fs28\cf1 14. Data boundaries and interpretation\b0\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab Live panels \u metrics, order cards, workers, allocation, explanations, and status \u describe the current episode only.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab Saved evaluation panels \u comparisons and research evidence \u summarize repeated evaluation runs from result files.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab An attractive live run is a demonstration, not proof of general performance; use the evaluation panels for research claims.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab Decision explanations are contextual summaries of observable inputs, not causal model introspection.\par
\pard\li620\fi-300\tx620\sa70\fs20\bullet\tab Conflict counts and takeover counts are distinct: a takeover may be legal but still disruptive.\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\keepn\sb280\sa130\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw12\brdrcf2\b\fs28\cf1 15. Running the dashboard\b0\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\fs20\cf1 From the repository root:\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\li360\ri360\f1\fs18\highlight8 python app.py\line
\pard\sa100\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\fs20\cf1 Then open http://localhost:5000 (http://localhost:5000). Select a scenario, press Reset to apply it, and use Step for inspection or Run for continuous playback.\par
\pard\sa35\par
\pard\sa120\sl276\slmult1\fs20\cf1 The dashboard is self-contained: its component styles, responsive rules, icons, and workflow graphics are defined within the application rather than loaded from an external UI framework or image service.\par
}
